# The link check's ignore list for every book (.github/workflows/book-link-check.yml).
# automation/scripts/lychee-ignore.mjs fills in the book's address below from its
# registry entry and appends the book's own .lycheeignore, if it has one.
https://__SITE_DOMAIN__
# doi.org answers link checkers with 403 (it turns away automated requests), so its
# links can't be checked from here; a DOI that is wrong is the reference's problem,
# not the link's.
^https?://(dx\.)?doi\.org/
